# Defect d-lane-blocking-small-1 (2026-11-24): `heroes add -C app --path`
# given a folder's absolute path looked for it under the program's folder,
# `app//<abs>/lib`, and said there was no folder there; the build already read
# such an entry from the path as written. The folder is now asked where the
# build reads it, the package its own catalogue names is added beside it, and
# a folder that is not there is told by the path the author wrote.
use <lib>/lib

function main()
    print(lib.x().to_str())
